  "details": "As far as I know there is not currently a way to make TrackIR work as a standalone replacement to an HMD. However I believe it should be supported further, as it would make the increased interaction that’s available to VR uzers more accessible.\n\nI personally play Arma III which functions much better with TrackIR, and as such I have TrackIR but no HMD atm. I don’t know how many others have a similar scenario, but broadening support for devices would be a good addition.",
